 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Before you quit clipping, check which of these 4 myths you believed.",
   "rate": "+4%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "I'll bust each one, then show the setup, step by step.",
   "rate": "+6%",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Myth one: you need a big following first.",
   "rate": "+0%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Fact: campaigns pay for the views on each clip, not followers.",
   "rate": "+6%",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "A brand new page can still land a viral clip.",
   "rate": "+8%",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Myth two: clipping is easy money overnight.",
   "rate": "+0%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Fact: the typical campaign pays about a dollar per thousand views.",
   "rate": "+4%",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "So fifty thousand views earns roughly fifty bucks, not a fortune.",
   "rate": "+4%",
   "pitch": "-3Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "It adds up with volume, not with one lucky post.",
   "rate": "+6%",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Myth three: you need to be a pro editor.",
   "rate": "+0%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Fact: the editing is quick. Finding the moment is what eats your day.",
   "rate": "+6%",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "That's the part I hand to Clipzy.",
   "rate": "+2%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Drop in a stream link, live or an old replay, and it watches the chat.",
   "rate": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "The second chat explodes, it marks the moment and clips half a minute around it.",
   "rate": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it flips it vertical, facecam up top, gameplay below, captions word by word.",
   "rate": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep the bangers, skip the duds, then post.",
   "rate": "+6%",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Myth four: you have to pay to get into the good campaigns.",
   "rate": "+2%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Fact: real campaigns are free. An entry fee means a scam.",
   "rate": "+4%",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "And only clip streamers or campaigns that clearly give permission.",
   "rate": "+4%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "The real recipe: a free campaign, a creator who says yes, and daily posts.",
   "rate": "+10%",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Every day you wait, someone else posts that moment first.",
   "rate": "+4%",
   "pitch": "-3Hz",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Comment clip, and I'll DM you how I set it up.",
   "rate": "+2%",
   "gap": 0.2
  }
 ],
